/regional_correlation_heatmap.png","bytes":285595,"sha256":"ff98bc768959a4c404f8fbe6fec9888846d27c783014a0d38d05c5b59b4d541e","width":3627,"height":1765,"png_crc_and_decompression":"passed"}],"archive":{"name":"frontend_data.zip","url":"frontend_data.zip","sha256":"df2595e5970fd1e6f86d77fcdfc3ce779797965a6929a030ee5ca9566620031e"},"specification":{"name":"EarthSignal_NASA_ZIP_Integration_Spec.md","url":"integration-spec.md","sha256":"6b1e5aaea52f57c9fc0e51c0dfaa07f9baae112ea687c14473a7682babb3f962"},"references":[{"title":"NASA MERRA-2 citation guidance","url":"https://gmao.gsfc.nasa.gov/gmao-products/merra-2/citing-merra-2-data_merra-2/"},{"title":"NASA MERRA-2 FAQ and variable interpretation","url":"https://gmao.gsfc.nasa.gov/gmao-products/merra-2/faq_merra-2/"}],"limitations":["Actual archive prefix is frontend_data/, not arabian_earth_trends/. Seven figure names have numeric prefixes; original filenames are preserved.","Annual precipitation values are sums of monthly totals, displayed as mm/year although source column names end in _MM_MONTH. Other annual variables are arithmetic monthly means, not day-weighted means.","The specification reports NASA MERRA-2 sources and cos(latitude) × FRLAND weights; raw granules, grid weights, exact product versions and preprocessing code are not supplied, so upstream NASA extraction and the claimed 1,384-cell spatial audit cannot be independently verified from this package.","Supplied statistical CSVs remain authoritative, with fixed 2000–2025 coverage. Chart-window changes do not recompute these tests.","Zero p-values are retained as reported numerical precision, not interpreted as proof of zero probability."],"data":{"url":"data.json","sha256":"e1b57b34e1ee8e6d0919dacb8f6e5113f86bf36ddd8fc2d1d357047c69753d45"}}